    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 781270,
      "end_ms": 782870,
      "text": "你做不到啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 782870,
      "end_ms": 783870,
      "text": "你做不到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 783870,
      "end_ms": 784570,
      "text": "你那个眼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 784570,
      "end_ms": 785230,
      "text": "你那个影"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 785230,
      "end_ms": 786859,
      "text": "你憋不住啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 787019,
      "end_ms": 788219,
      "text": "你那个骚气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 788219,
      "end_ms": 790359,
      "text": "你没办法给他捏捏住啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 790359,
      "end_ms": 792019,
      "text": "你做不到啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 793560,
      "end_ms": 795120,
      "text": "你做不到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 795120,
      "end_ms": 797940,
      "text": "你不要跟我们一跟我没关系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 797940,
      "end_ms": 799160,
      "text": "做不到你哈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 799160,
      "end_ms": 801880,
      "text": "你就首先不要在我们眼皮子可见的地方"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 801880,
      "end_ms": 803560,
      "text": "让我们感受到你的那种骚气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 803560,
      "end_ms": 804550,
      "text": "那种敌意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 804550,
      "end_ms": 805690,
      "text": "另外一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 805690,
      "end_ms": 807790,
      "text": "如果现实当中跟跟人打交道的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 807790,
      "end_ms": 809790,
      "text": "我们会尽量少跟你打交道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 809790,
      "end_ms": 811790,
      "text": "越热板边缘化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 812060,
      "end_ms": 814360,
      "text": "这是一个基本要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 814360,
      "end_ms": 815940,
      "text": "那么这个是日常生活中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 815940,
      "end_ms": 817980,
      "text": "一直要维持住的一个基本要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 817980,
      "end_ms": 818510,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 818510,
      "end_ms": 821430,
      "text": "我希望绝大部分人在自己的微信里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 821430,
      "end_ms": 822890,
      "text": "只和亲朋好友沟通"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 822890,
      "end_ms": 825400,
      "text": "生活相关的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 825400,
      "end_ms": 826560,
      "text": "切身利益重大"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 826560,
      "end_ms": 828920,
      "text": "利益直接相关的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 831520,
      "end_ms": 835320,
      "text": "不要在这个即时通讯软件上面聊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 836530,
      "end_ms": 839490,
      "text": "尤其不要在群组里面聊你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 839490,
      "end_ms": 841150,
      "text": "但凡你聊你就不是我们的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 841150,
      "end_ms": 844670,
      "text": "我们就是要以这种方式来划分敌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 844670,
      "end_ms": 845270,
      "text": "我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 845270,
      "end_ms": 847590,
      "text": "不是划分外人和自己人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 847590,
      "end_ms": 852250,
      "text": "甚至说只要我们发现他是在这种群组里面呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 852250,
      "end_ms": 853590,
      "text": "刻意的这样去吹水"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 853590,
      "end_ms": 854270,
      "text": "这样口嗨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 854270,
      "end_ms": 857160,
      "text": "这种人是潜在的敌人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 857160,
      "end_ms": 858760,
      "text": "你不要以为他就是普通人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 858760,
      "end_ms": 859080,
      "text": "路人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 859080,
      "end_ms": 859600,
      "text": "不是的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 859600,
      "end_ms": 862380,
      "text": "这种事是潜在的敌人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 862540,
      "end_ms": 865520,
      "text": "希望你们能明白这里面的这种敌对性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 865520,
      "end_ms": 869260,
      "text": "他们在玷污这些"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 869980,
      "end_ms": 870860,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 870860,
      "end_ms": 872760,
      "text": "他们在玷污这些话语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 872760,
      "end_ms": 875900,
      "text": "他们在促成政治话语的腐败"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 876460,
      "end_ms": 879020,
      "text": "你那哪怕是泄愤性质的话语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 879020,
      "end_ms": 882690,
      "text": "哪怕是异议话语啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 882690,
      "end_ms": 885930,
      "text": "哪怕是这个就是反抗性批判性的话语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 885930,
      "end_ms": 888310,
      "text": "但是如果他只是吹水口嗨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 888310,
      "end_ms": 890010,
      "text": "他是在玷污这些话语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 890010,
      "end_ms": 892430,
      "text": "在造成这些话语的腐败"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 892430,
      "end_ms": 893650,
      "text": "他不落到实处"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 893650,
      "end_ms": 894250,
      "text": "这是一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 894250,
      "end_ms": 895970,
      "text": "另外一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 896690,
      "end_ms": 900690,
      "text": "它使得这样的意思的表达变成一个非常廉价的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 900690,
      "end_ms": 902760,
      "text": "没有后果的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 902760,
      "end_ms": 905220,
      "text": "那么实际上是在引诱无产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 905220,
      "end_ms": 908420,
      "text": "陷于政治上的幼稚和盲动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 909690,
      "end_ms": 913610,
      "text": "啊所以这种风气是绝对要刹住的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 913610,
      "end_ms": 915110,
      "text": "咳咳咳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 915110,
      "end_ms": 921009,
      "text": "然后呢就是说应当你要介绍朋友啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 921009,
      "end_ms": 923610,
      "text": "跟我们一起去做生意啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 923610,
      "end_ms": 925490,
      "text": "赚一个盼头啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 925490,
      "end_ms": 927960,
      "text": "就是为自己人生去追求一个盼头"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 927960,
      "end_ms": 929200,
      "text": "那你要跟他说清楚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 929200,
      "end_ms": 931180,
      "text": "要坚持这个原则"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 931180,
      "end_ms": 933080,
      "text": "要把它作为一个基本原则"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 933080,
      "end_ms": 933640,
      "text": "他收不了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 933640,
      "end_ms": 935410,
      "text": "那就别带他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 935530,
      "end_ms": 936230,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 936230,
      "end_ms": 938390,
      "text": "有我我们也有我们的生意啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 938390,
      "end_ms": 940970,
      "text": "卖水果啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 940970,
      "end_ms": 941610,
      "text": "卖电脑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 941610,
      "end_ms": 942530,
      "text": "卖小电脑啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 943530,
      "end_ms": 947700,
      "text": "还有包括就是说就是呃就是培训开车啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 947700,
      "end_ms": 949280,
      "text": "就是当司机什么这些"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 949280,
      "end_ms": 952100,
      "text": "反正有我们有我们自己的一些很微不足道的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 952100,
      "end_ms": 952700,
      "text": "很廉价的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 952700,
      "end_ms": 955980,
      "text": "很很很挫的一种一种一种生存方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 955980,
      "end_ms": 958260,
      "text": "那"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 963740,
      "end_ms": 965480,
      "text": "这是一个基本的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 965480,
      "end_ms": 968100,
      "text": "你把它理解成类似于戒律吧好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 968100,
      "end_ms": 971829,
      "text": "这是你日常要持持的一个借"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 971829,
      "end_ms": 973309,
      "text": "你吃不了这个戒律"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 974309,
      "end_ms": 977429,
      "text": "给老子滚一边去好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 982020,
      "end_ms": 985580,
      "text": "就是这种自由是有毒的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 985580,
      "end_ms": 987220,
      "text": "这种嘴巴上吹水"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 987220,
      "end_ms": 989810,
      "text": "这种东西是有毒的玩意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 989810,
      "end_ms": 991530,
      "text": "他不能落到实处"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 991530,
      "end_ms": 993430,
      "text": "你念那些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 993430,
      "end_ms": 994410,
      "text": "口嗨的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 994410,
      "end_ms": 996430,
      "text": "你根本拿没一个能做得到的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 996430,
      "end_ms": 999950,
      "text": "或者说根本在现实中没有落地可能性的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 999950,
      "end_ms": 1001070,
      "text": "你还敢还搁在这"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 1001070,
      "end_ms": 1002390,
      "text": "就是说大词儿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 1002390,
      "end_ms": 1005800,
      "text": "或者是口嗨的黑油油的东西往外面冒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 1005800,
      "end_ms": 1011500,
      "text": "这就是一个自己的意向表达的一种自欺啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 1011500,
      "end_ms": 1012980,
      "text": "自欺欺人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 1012980,
      "end_ms": 1014200,
      "text": "这就是想忽悠别人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 1014200,
      "end_ms": 1014800,
      "text": "蒙骗别人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 1014800,
      "end_ms": 1015780,
      "text": "煽动别人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 1015780,
      "end_ms": 1022109,
      "text": "那么就是严格禁止这种行为好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 1022820,
      "end_ms": 1028980,
      "text": "那么这些人呢就是说呃有很多类似这种人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 1029380,
      "end_ms": 1032260,
      "text": "就被我们以这种方式其实是清掉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 1032260,
      "end_ms": 1032660,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 1034020,
      "end_ms": 1034579,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 1034579,
      "end_ms": 1036670,
      "text": "或者说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 1037349,
      "end_ms": 1041869,
      "text": "做不到就不要说是我们自己人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 371,
      "start_ms": 1041869,
      "end_ms": 1043470,
      "text": "做不到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 372,
      "start_ms": 1044859,
      "end_ms": 1050030,
      "text": "啊我们这的是这就是我们发现了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 373,
      "start_ms": 1050030,
      "end_ms": 1052120,
      "text": "我们就会把你清掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 374,
      "start_ms": 1052920,
      "end_ms": 1054280,
      "text": "你不你可以藏得了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 375,
      "start_ms": 1054280,
      "end_ms": 1056080,
      "text": "一时你藏不了一世好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 376,
      "start_ms": 1056080,
      "end_ms": 1060420,
      "text": "嗯就是你们喜欢这种哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 377,
      "start_ms": 1060420,
      "end_ms": 1063000,
      "text": "这不是说不允许你们讨论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 378,
      "start_ms": 1063000,
      "end_ms": 1064200,
      "text": "你可以讨论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 379,
      "start_ms": 1064200,
      "end_ms": 1068680,
      "text": "但是要落到你实质的实际的现实的利益啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 380,
      "start_ms": 1068680,
      "end_ms": 1071340,
      "text": "人身安全啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 381,
      "start_ms": 1071340,
      "end_ms": 1076200,
      "text": "历史就是非常切身的现实的一种选择啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 382,
      "start_ms": 1076200,
      "end_ms": 1079570,
      "text": "除此之外就不要讨论了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 383,
      "start_ms": 1080290,
      "end_ms": 1081270,
      "text": "行吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 384,
      "start_ms": 1081270,
      "end_ms": 1082580,
      "text": "那讲到这边啊"
